### Edge Cases and Guards

| Scenario | Guard Location | Behavior |
|---|---|---|
| Kill an already-dead agent | `stopAgent` in ws.ts | tmux kill-session is try/caught; closing a null/closed socket is a no-op; status set to "done" is idempotent |
| Relaunch a running agent | `relaunch_agent` handler | Check `claudeSocket.readyState === OPEN`, send error if so |
| Relaunch agent with no sessionId | `relaunch_agent` handler | Check `agent.sessionId`, send error if null |
| Delete the currently-active agent | `deleteAgent` in hook | Set `activeAgentId` to null; server broadcasts updated agent_list which removes the agent from client-side Map via existing reconciliation (lines 318-354 of the hook) |
| Rename to empty string | Sidebar onBlur/onKeyDown | Only call `onRename` if `renameValue.trim()` is truthy |
| Clear history of running agent | Allowed | Only clears message display; the running CLI is unaffected |
| Context menu dismissed | Click-outside `useEffect` | Sets `contextMenu` to null |

