### File 4: `/Users/chiu.fyi/work/personal/thos/components/dashboard/agent-sidebar.tsx`

This is where the bulk of the UI changes go. Add a context menu using a simple state-managed dropdown (or use Radix DropdownMenu, which is available via the `radix-ui` dependency).

#### New props

```typescript
export function AgentSidebar({
  agents,
  agentOrder,
  activeAgentId,
  onSelect,
  onNewAgent,
  onKill,
  onRelaunch,
  onDelete,
  onRename,
  onClearHistory,
}: {
